DATASET NOTICE

The WiFi Signal Quality dataset containing 100 records is used in this project to develop and evaluate a machine learning model for predicting WiFi signal quality.

The dataset may contain features such as signal strength (RSSI), noise level, signal-to-noise ratio (SNR), channel frequency, and other network-related parameters, depending on the dataset used in this project.

Dataset Information:

Project: WiFi Signal Quality Prediction

Number of records: 100

Purpose: Machine learning-based WiFi signal quality classification or prediction.

Dataset source: Specify the original source if the dataset was obtained from an external repository. If the 100 records were generated or collected specifically for this project, state that instead.

The dataset is not included in this repository unless explicitly provided. See data/README.md for dataset details, download instructions, and attribution information, if applicable.

If the dataset is derived from an external source, the original dataset license and attribution requirements must also be followed.
